## Layout rules

This files defines the layour rules.

1. always center the main div in the middle
```html
<div className="fixed inset-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-neutral-800">
   {/* ...rest of code... */}
</div>
```

2. Always use toast to show status of the POST, PUT, DELETE requests

3. always follow the image layout provided

4. if image layoyt is missing base youself [Register.tsx](mdc:src/components/Register.tsx) page

5. prefer to use radix components

6. If a new page is created a new route in the [App.tsx](mdc:src/App.tsx) should be create